sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    CSMS->>CS: GetChargingProfilesRequest
    CS-->>CSMS: GetChargingProfilesResponse (status = Accepted)
    CS->>CSMS: ReportChargingProfilesRequest (requestId = Generated Id, chargingProfile.chargingProfilePurpose = ChargingStationExternalConstraints)
    CSMS-->>CS: ReportChargingProfilesResponse
